<view class="page"><view class="heading">资金记录</view><view class="sub">资金状态以支付渠道实际结果为准。</view><view class="card funds" wx:if="funds"><view class="tag warn" wx:if="funds.mode==='mock'">模拟资金，仅供内部测试</view><view class="note">待结算</view><view class="balance">¥{{funds.pendingYuan}}</view><view class="divider"/><view class="row"><view><view class="sub">处理中</view><view class="amount">¥{{funds.processingYuan}}</view></view><view><view class="sub">已结算</view><view class="amount">¥{{funds.settledYuan}}</view></view></view></view><view class="note">本页仅展示卖家交易资金记录，不提供充值或提现。买家确认收货后结算；未确认且已交付、无退款或纠纷的订单，在付款满 7 天后进入结算。</view><view class="label">资金明细</view><view wx:for="{{funds.ledger}}" wx:key="id" class="card" data-id="{{item.orderId}}" bindtap="order"><view class="row"><text>{{item.label}}</text><text>¥{{item.yuan}}</text></view><view class="time">{{item.time}}</view></view><view wx:if="funds&&!funds.ledger.length" class="empty">还没有卖家资金记录</view></view>
